<title>UK: Carlton continues higher on Morgan upgrade.</title>
<headline>Carlton continues higher on Morgan upgrade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Carlton Communications Plc extended their gains on Thursday morning after brokerage Morgan Stanley on Wednesday upgraded the stock, dealers said.</p>
<p>By 0815 GMT, the shares were up 14-1/2p to 521.</p>
<p>&quot;It's just follow through on yesterday's upgrade,&quot; said one market maker.</p>
<p>The shares rose on Wednesday after the investment bank raised Carlton to &quot;strong buy&quot; from &quot;outperform,&quot; saying the stock looked cheap.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
